WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.220 --> 00:00:04.140
Forgetting ... forgetting is a good thing.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:09.270
Hi there, Steve Kaufmann, and
today I wanna talk about vocabulary

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:11.490
and the importance of forgetting.

00:00:12.660 --> 00:00:15.360
Remember, if you enjoy these
videos, please subscribe.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:17.970
Click on the bell to get notified
when there's a new video.

